{
  "_note": "空气质量取数流 —— 四个单城市组件、首页城市行、城市详情页共用这一份(页面传 _cache:1 走三态缓存,组件不传)。\n两套标准(中国 HJ 633 / 美国 EPA)按 data.aqStd 选一套算,输出键两套同名。\n由 tools/infosource/gen_air.py 生成,改这里的逻辑请改生成器。",
  "version": 1,
  "i18n": {
    "zh-CN": {
      "autoCn": "上海",
      "autoUs": "纽约"
    },
    "en-US": {
      "autoCn": "Shanghai",
      "autoUs": "New York"
    }
  },
  "actions": [
    {
      "_note": "wxenv.auto_city:组件默认参数是哨兵 `auto`(doc/overseas-first.md §3)—— 城市不写进 .xwidget,在这里按 cnd 兜底:国内默认上海,海外默认纽约。用户选过城市就是真坐标,原样用。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_latIn",
        "value": "${lat}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_lonIn",
        "value": "${lon}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_cityRaw",
        "value": "${city}"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "国内默认判据(doc/overseas-first.md §1,逐字照抄):地区 cn,或地区未知且界面中文 → 1。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cnd",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${@app.region},cn),1,if::(eq::(${@app.region},overseas),0,if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_auto",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_latIn},auto),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lat",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_auto},1),if::(eq::(${cnd},1),31.2222,40.7128),${_latIn})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lon",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_auto},1),if::(eq::(${cnd},1),121.4581,-74.0060),${_lonIn})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "城市名走本文件 A 表(按 App 语言);宿主没注入 @i18n 时退回英文。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_cityIn",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_auto},1),if::(eq::(${cnd},1),findNotEmpty::(${@i18n.autoCn},Shanghai),findNotEmpty::(${@i18n.autoUs},New York)),${_cityRaw})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "页面传 `_cache: 1` 走三态缓存;`.xwidget` 不传 → 空 → 0 → 全程不碰缓存,每次真取数(§5.5.2 契约 5)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cacheIn",
        "value": "${_cache}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "useCache",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${cacheIn},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "页面 state.reval:0/缺省 = 有缓存就用;1 = 缓存过期才重取(进页校新);2 = 一律重取(下拉)。\n重取成功整份覆盖写入缓存,失败时缓存原样留着、页面保留旧内容 —— **从不先删键**(删键再取会让「读缓存」与「删缓存」赛跑)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "revalIn",
        "value": "${_reval}"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "未写过 state 时入参是原样透传的字面串,判不等于 1/2 → 0。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "reval",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${revalIn},2),2,if::(eq::(${revalIn},1),1,0))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "缓存结构版本号:pack 字段集变了就 +1。从 1 起,绝不能用 0(eq::(空,0) 恒真)。\n包 v3 起 = 3:键里加了标准,pack 加了 lk / wS / bestS / bwFlat / ym*(施工中本地用过 2)。\n包 v4 = 4:trendKey 判据改了(档位变 或 数值变 ≥ 20),旧缓存里的走势作废。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "SCHEMA",
        "value": "4"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "标准设置:`data.aqStd` = cn / us;没写过(新用户)按国内默认判据 cnd 定默认(cnd → 中国标准,其它 → 美国标准,doc/overseas-first.md §7)。\n切语言平台会整盘重取,地区随渠道不变,所以缺省值不需要额外的刷新通路。",
      "id": "sv",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "aqStd",
        "default": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "屏障(勿删):request / data.get 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(晚一拍),隔一个空 set 再用。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_bs",
        "value": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lang",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${@app.language},en)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "国内默认判据(doc/overseas-first.md §1,逐字照抄):地区 cn,或地区未知且界面中文 → 1。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cnd",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${@app.region},cn),1,if::(eq::(${@app.region},overseas),0,if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "std",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${sv},cn),cn,if::(eq::(${sv},us),us,if::(eq::(${cnd},1),cn,us)))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "缓存键 = 标准 + 城市坐标(稳定标识,绝不用下标)。语言 / 明暗不进键:pack 里不含任何文案。\n切标准 = 换一个键:另一套没缓存过就真取一次,之后两套各自命中。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ckey",
        "value": "$[connect::(c.aq.,${std},.,${lat},_,${lon})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "读缓存。`default:{}` 让无缓存时 ${hit.ts} 安全取空。",
      "id": "hit",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${ckey}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "屏障(勿删):request / data.get 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(晚一拍),隔一个空 set 再用。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_bh",
        "value": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hitSchema",
        "value": "${hit.schema}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nowMs",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hitTs",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${hit.ts},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "age",
        "value": "$[calc::(${nowMs}-${hitTs})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "有货 = 结构对得上 且 没超 hardTTL(12 小时)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hasHit",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${hitSchema},${SCHEMA}),if::(gt::(${hitTs},0),if::(lt::(${age},43200000),1,0),0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "ttl = 10 分钟(数据每小时一版)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "fresh",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${hitTs},0),if::(lt::(${age},600000),1,0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "「这次先出的是旧货,请后台校新」—— 页面 onLoad 靠它决定要不要校新(已经在校新的这一趟不再报)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_stale",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${useCache},1),if::(eq::(${hasHit},1),if::(eq::(${fresh},1),0,if::(eq::(${reval},0),1,0)),0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "只有「开了缓存 且 有没超 hardTTL 的货」才跳过网络(stale 也跳过,首屏零等待;校新交给页面 onLoad)。\nreval=1 时过期的货也进来重取,reval=2 一律重取。组件(useCache=0)与冷启一律进来真取数。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "doNet",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${useCache},1),if::(eq::(${hasHit},1),if::(eq::(${reval},2),1,if::(eq::(${reval},1),if::(eq::(${fresh},1),0,1),0)),1),1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "真取数:算好的键就是输出,不再从缓存对象抄一遍(v4:省掉 176 次赋值,web 引擎里首开 / 切标准那一趟明显变快)。",
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[eq::(${doNet},1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "_note": "Open-Meteo 空气质量接口(CAMS 模型,约 11 km 格点,是模型值不是监测站实测)。\n`forecast_hours=48` 让逐时序列从**当前整点**起算(不带它是从当天 00:00 起,「现在」那根柱子位置会随时刻漂)。\n`timezone=auto` → 所有时间都是**这座城市的当地时间**。\n逐时要六项浓度:中国标准的逐时 AQI 由它们现算(接口只给 US AQI)。",
          "id": "resp",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://air-quality-api.open-meteo.com/v1/air-quality?latitude=${lat}&longitude=${lon}&current=us_aqi,pm2_5,pm10,ozone,nitrogen_dioxide,sulphur_dioxide,carbon_monoxide,uv_index,us_aqi_pm2_5,us_aqi_pm10,us_aqi_ozone,us_aqi_nitrogen_dioxide,us_aqi_sulphur_dioxide,us_aqi_carbon_monoxide&hourly=us_aqi,uv_index,pm2_5,pm10,ozone,nitrogen_dioxide,sulphur_dioxide,carbon_monoxide&forecast_hours=48&timezone=auto",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "屏障(勿删):request / data.get 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(晚一拍),隔一个空 set 再用。",
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_b",
            "value": "1"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "主干判据 ①:连模型时次都没有 = 这次没拿到答案(网络 / 接口挂了)→ 抛错,平台回落上次成功的数据(G26 / §7.2)。",
          "op": "if",
          "props": {
            "val": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp.current.time}),0),0,1)]"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "action": "error",
              "params": {
                "errorMsg": "air_unreachable"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "aqiRaw",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.us_aqi},__none__)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "主干判据 ②:有时次但 AQI 是 null(格点在海上 / 模型缺值)= 这个组件没内容可渲 → 抛错。\n⚠️ 用哨兵串比较,不用 length::(它对数字恒返 0,会把好数据判成空)。\n中国标准也用这条判:模型缺值时六项浓度与 US AQI 一起缺。",
          "op": "if",
          "props": {
            "val": "$[if::(eq::(${aqiRaw},__none__),1,0)]"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "action": "error",
              "params": {
                "errorMsg": "aqi_missing"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_note": "写回哨兵:**直接取响应字段,不加任何兜底** —— 取数失败/响应变形时它必空,缓存就不被空 pack 覆盖(§5.5.2 契约 4)。",
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_guard",
            "value": "${resp.current.time}"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "有数据旗标:渲染层只看它判「有没有」,不去猜某个数字是不是空。",
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "ok",
            "value": "1"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "城市名不参与取数,但组件要显示 —— 外壳 params 不在渲染域,必须经流透出(G28)。",
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "city",
            "value": "${_cityIn}"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "时间锚 = **模型时次**(城市当地时间),不是取数时刻:数据每小时一版,取数时刻会把一小时前的数说成「刚刚」。",
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "at",
            "value": "$[subString::(${resp.current.time},11,16)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "浓度 μg/m³。缺值渲 `--`,不拿 0 顶(0 会被读成「没有污染」)。\n≥ 100 只留整数(2026-10-08):分项组件格宽 73pt,「133.6 μg/m³」把单位的 ³ 挤出格外;三位数的小数位也没有读数意义。",
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "pm25",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.pm2_5},__none__),__none__),,if::(ge::(${resp.current.pm2_5},99.95),parseNumber::(round::(${resp.current.pm2_5}),0),parseNumber::(${resp.current.pm2_5},0.#)))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "pm10",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.pm10},__none__),__none__),,if::(ge::(${resp.current.pm10},99.95),parseNumber::(round::(${resp.current.pm10}),0),parseNumber::(${resp.current.pm10},0.#)))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "o3",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.ozone},__none__),__none__),,if::(ge::(${resp.current.ozone},99.95),parseNumber::(round::(${resp.current.ozone}),0),parseNumber::(${resp.current.ozone},0.#)))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "no2",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.nitrogen_dioxide},__none__),__none__),,if::(ge::(${resp.current.nitrogen_dioxide},99.95),parseNumber::(round::(${resp.current.nitrogen_dioxide}),0),parseNumber::(${resp.current.nitrogen_dioxide},0.#)))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "so2",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.sulphur_dioxide},__none__),__none__),,if::(ge::(${resp.current.sulphur_dioxide},99.95),parseNumber::(round::(${resp.current.sulphur_dioxide}),0),parseNumber::(${resp.current.sulphur_dioxide},0.#)))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "CO 按国内惯例显示 mg/m³(接口给 μg/m³,÷1000);其余五项 μg/m³。",
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "co",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.carbon_monoxide},__none__),__none__),,parseNumber::(calc::(${resp.current.carbon_monoxide}/1000),0.##))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "美国标准:AQI、分指数、逐时 AQI 都直接用接口给的 US AQI(PM 按 24 小时均值、O₃ 按 8 小时均值折算)。",
          "op": "if",
          "props": {
            "val": "$[eq::(${std},us)]"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "_note": "分指数(该项单独折成的 AQI)。⚠️ parseNumber 外必须先 findNotEmpty —— parseNumber::(null,…) 不给默认值、整体求空。",
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "a_pm25",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.us_aqi_pm2_5},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "a_pm10",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.us_aqi_pm10},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "a_o3",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.us_aqi_ozone},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "a_no2",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.us_aqi_nitrogen_dioxide},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "a_so2",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.us_aqi_sulphur_dioxide},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "a_co",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.us_aqi_carbon_monoxide},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "aqi",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(${aqiRaw},0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "_note": "逐时 AQI;缺值 = -1 哨兵(不当 0,0 是「空气极好」)。",
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "v0",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.hourly.us_aqi[0]},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "v1",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.hourly.us_aqi[1]},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "v2",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.hourly.us_aqi[2]},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "v3",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.hourly.us_aqi[3]},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "v4",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.hourly.us_aqi[4]},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "v5",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.hourly.us_aqi[5]},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "v6",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.hourly.us_aqi[6]},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "v7",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.hourly.us_aqi[7]},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "v8",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.hourly.us_aqi[8]},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "v9",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.hourly.us_aqi[9]},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "v10",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.hourly.us_aqi[10]},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "v11",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.hourly.us_aqi[11]},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "v12",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.hourly.us_aqi[12]},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "v13",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.hourly.us_aqi[13]},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "v14",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.hourly.us_aqi[14]},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "v15",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.hourly.us_aqi[15]},-1),0)]"
              }
            },
