        {
          "_note": "中国标准(HJ 633-2012,实时报口径):由六项浓度逐项算分指数(见生成器 CN_BP 分段表),\nAQI = 分指数最大值。PM2.5 / PM10 用小时浓度对照 24 小时分段;O₃ / NO₂ / CO 用 1 小时分段;\nSO₂ 1 小时浓度 > 800 时按 24 小时分段(表 1 注 2)。首要污染物同样取分指数最大者(AQI > 50 时)。",
          "op": "if",
          "props": {
            "val": "$[eq::(${std},cn)]"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "_note": "HJ 633 式(1)的分段线性插值,写成「逐段夹紧求和」:IAQI = Σ 斜率ₖ ×(clamp(C, 下限ₖ, 上限ₖ) − 下限ₖ)。\n不用 if 链选段 —— memory:「经 if:: 出来的数字再喂 calc 会算错」「数字分支的深层 if 返 null」,\n夹紧求和只有 min / max / calc,没有一个 if。超过顶端自动封顶 500;缺值哨兵 -1 → 0(由调用方另行判缺)。\nHJ 633 §6.2「计算结果全部进位取整」= ceil;写成 floor(x + 0.999999),免得 -0 与浮点尾差(49.9999999 → 50)。\n斜率写成分数(50/35*…):短,且由 calc 现算,不带十位小数的截断误差。\n缺值的那项分指数 = -1(不参与取最大,也不画档位色)。",
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "a_pm25",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::((floor::(calc::(10/7*min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.pm2_5},-1),0),35)+5/4*(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.pm2_5},-1),35),75)-35)+5/4*(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.pm2_5},-1),75),115)-75)+10/7*(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.pm2_5},-1),115),150)-115)+(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.pm2_5},-1),150),250)-150)+(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.pm2_5},-1),250),350)-250)+2/3*(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.pm2_5},-1),350),500)-350)+0.999999))+1)*min::(1,calc::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.pm2_5},-1)+1))-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "a_pm10",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::((floor::(calc::(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.pm10},-1),0),50)+1/2*(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.pm10},-1),50),150)-50)+1/2*(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.pm10},-1),150),250)-150)+1/2*(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.pm10},-1),250),350)-250)+10/7*(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.pm10},-1),350),420)-350)+5/4*(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.pm10},-1),420),500)-420)+(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.pm10},-1),500),600)-500)+0.999999))+1)*min::(1,calc::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.pm10},-1)+1))-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "a_o3",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::((floor::(calc::(5/16*min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.ozone},-1),0),160)+5/4*(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.ozone},-1),160),200)-160)+1/2*(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.ozone},-1),200),300)-200)+1/2*(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.ozone},-1),300),400)-300)+1/4*(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.ozone},-1),400),800)-400)+1/2*(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.ozone},-1),800),1000)-800)+1/2*(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.ozone},-1),1000),1200)-1000)+0.999999))+1)*min::(1,calc::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.ozone},-1)+1))-1),0)]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "a_no2",
                "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::((floor::(calc::(1/2*min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.nitrogen_dioxide},-1),0),100)+1/2*(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.nitrogen_dioxide},-1),100),200)-100)+1/10*(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.nitrogen_dioxide},-1),200),700)-200)+1/10*(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.nitrogen_dioxide},-1),700),1200)-700)+5/57*(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.nitrogen_dioxide},-1),1200),2340)-1200)+2/15*(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.nitrogen_dioxide},-1),2340),3090)-2340)+2/15*(min::(max::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.nitrogen_dioxide},-1),3090),3840)-3090)+0.999999))+1)*min::(1,calc::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.current.nitrogen_dioxide},-1)+1))-1),0)]"
